
=== 工具 ===
/usr/bin/pw-play
=== 默认 sink ===
用法：
  wpctl [选项…] COMMAND [COMMAND_OPTIONS] - WirePlumber Control CLI

Commands:
  status 
  get-volume ID
  inspect ID
  set-default ID
  set-volume ID VOL[%][-/+]
  set-mute ID 1|0|toggle
  set-profile ID INDEX
  clear-default [ID]

帮助选项：
  -h, --help       显示帮助选项

Pass -h after a command to see command-specific options

